Option 1:
    Ingredients and potions are locked behind milestones in-game and are a function of progress.

Option 2:
    Ingredients are fair game but potions are locked behind milestones.

Option 3:
    Everything is fair game but recipes are hidden until discovered.

Option 4:
    All crafting is fair game but most base-ingredients are locked from the start and are unlocked as a progression milestone.